## Project: Website Redesign 🚀

**Goal:** Modernize the company website for improved user experience and brand image.

**Phase 1: Research & Planning (2 weeks)**

*   ✅ Competitive Analysis - Analyze top competitors’ websites. 🕵️‍♀️
*   ✅ User Research - Conduct surveys & interviews to understand user needs. 🧑‍💻
*   ✅ Content Audit - Evaluate existing website content for relevance and accuracy. 📝
*   ✅ Sitemap Creation - Develop a new sitemap structure. 🗺️
*   ✅ Define Target Audience - Refine our understanding of the primary and secondary audiences. 🎯

**Phase 2: Design & Development (6 weeks)**

*   ✅ Wireframing - Create low-fidelity wireframes for key pages. ✏️
*   ✅ Mockup Design - Develop high-fidelity mockups. 🎨
*   ✅ Front-End Development - Build the website using React. ⚛️
*   ✅ Back-End Development - Set up the CMS (WordPress). ⚙️
*   ✅ Responsive Design - Ensure the website is accessible on all devices. 📱💻
*   ✅ Accessibility - Adhere to WCAG guidelines. ♿

**Phase 3: Testing & Launch (2 weeks)**

*   ✅ User Testing - Conduct usability testing with target users. 🙋‍♀️🙋‍♂️
*   ✅ Bug Fixing - Address any identified issues. 🐛
*   ✅ Performance Optimization - Improve website loading speed. ⚡
*   ✅ Content Migration - Transfer existing content to the new website. 📤
*   ✅ Launch - Deploy the website to the live server. 🎉

**Team:**

*   Sarah Jones - Project Manager
*   David Lee - Front-End Developer
*   Emily Chen - Content Writer
*   Michael Brown - UX Designer

**Key Metrics:**

*   Website Traffic 📈
*   Bounce Rate 📉
*   Conversion Rate 🎯
*   User Satisfaction 😃